t=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/sKvQO1d.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/0bzO6jP.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IyD3iA5.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/JmLbhkJ.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UWFTH8U.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xihe1Iq.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mttOKJb.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1S9UjyX.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8U6EqW7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/EY1Banv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pRShE0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ajOKaqG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xyN0hmi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Merge Enchantments 是一款<strong>伺服器端</strong>&nbsp;模組，您可混合或排除附魔，甚至將它們全部合併。部分範例包含&nbsp;鋒利、終結與節肢殺手、所有類型的保護（火焰、爆炸與彈射物）、絲綢之觸與時運、激流搭配引雷／迴歸、密度、破甲、終結與節肢殺手。請查看<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基</a>以了解設定檔的運作方式，您可以在其中建立<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki/Config#blacklist\" rel=\"nofollow\">黑名單</a>並<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki/Config#blacklist\" rel=\"nofollow\">合併所有內容</a>。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/H9nhuOr.gif\" width=\"414\" height=\"233\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/l717aDK.gif\" width=\"414\" height=\"234\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>常見問題</strong></span></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Q: 它是否能與其他模組的附魔相容？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">A: 自 v3.0 版本起，即可合併所有原版與外部模組的附魔。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Q: 如何同時獲得<span style=\"color:#008000\">絲綢之觸</span>與<span style=\"color:#9c0\">時運</span>？</strong><br>A: 您需要安裝 Merge Enchantments 以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toggle-enchantments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Toggle Enchantments<br></a><strong>Q: 如何讓<span style=\"color:#36f\">激流</span>與<span style=\"color:#f60\">迴歸</span>及<span style=\"color:#fc0\">引雷</span>共存？</strong><br>A: 您需要安裝 Merge Enchantments 以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/improved-trident-enchantments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Improved Trident Enchantments</a></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Q: 這是客戶端還是伺服器端模組？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">A: 自 v4.2 版本起，此模組僅為伺服器端。<br><strong>Q: 我可以將 Merge Enchantments 納入我的模組包中嗎？</strong><br>A: 當然可以，只需將我的模組加入相關專案/模組包中即可。</span></li>\n</ul>",
